job-whitelists-window-search = Search jobs...
job-whitelists-window-only-required = Only whitelist-required jobs
job-whitelists-window-grant-shown = Grant all shown
job-whitelists-window-revoke-shown = Revoke all shown
job-whitelists-window-other = Other
job-whitelists-window-not-required = This job does not require a whitelist. Granting it only matters if it becomes whitelisted later.
job-whitelists-window-group = Shares one whitelist with every job in the {$group} group.
